#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkCellGrid-improvements.md:1
msgid "Improved vtkCellGrid support in data model and filters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkCellGrid-improvements.md:3
msgid "`vtkDataObject::GetAttributeTypeAsString`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkCellGrid-improvements.md:5
msgid ""
"`vtkDataObject` now provides a new static method "
"`GetAttributeTypeAsString(int attributeType)` that converts an integer "
"attribute-type constant (e.g., `vtkDataObject::POINT`, `vtkDataObject::"
"CELL`) to its string name. This is the symmetric counterpart of the existing "
"`GetAssociationTypeAsString`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkCellGrid-improvements.md:9
msgid "`vtkCellGrid::GetAttributesAsFieldData`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkCellGrid-improvements.md:11
msgid ""
"`vtkCellGrid` now overrides `GetAttributesAsFieldData(int type)` from "
"`vtkDataObject`. Generic algorithms that call `GetAttributesAsFieldData` on "
"a `vtkDataObject` pointer now work correctly when the underlying dataset is "
"a `vtkCellGrid`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkCellGrid-improvements.md:15
msgid "`vtkAttributeDataToTableFilter`: Support `vtkCellGrid`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkCellGrid-improvements.md:17
msgid ""
"`vtkAttributeDataToTableFilter` now accepts `vtkCellGrid` as input, in "
"addition to the dataset and composite types it already handled. This allows "
"attribute data from a `vtkCellGrid` to be converted to a table."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkCellGrid-improvements.md:20
msgid ""
"`vtkCellGridSummaryInformationQuery`: New query for per-attribute summary "
"information"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkCellGrid-improvements.md:22
msgid ""
"A new `vtkCellGridSummaryInformationQuery` computes per-attribute summary "
"information for a `vtkCellGrid` in a single traversal. For each "
"`vtkCellAttribute`, the query accumulates:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkCellGrid-improvements.md:25
msgid ""
"**Polynomial order range** — the minimum and maximum polynomial order across "
"all cell types that carry the attribute. Retrieve it with "
"`GetOrderRange(vtkCellAttribute*)`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkCellGrid-improvements.md:27
msgid ""
"**Degrees of freedom count** — the total number of degrees of freedom for "
"the attribute, correctly accounting for shared DOFs when the attribute uses "
"DOF sharing. Retrieve it with `GetNumberOfDOF(vtkCellAttribute*)`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/vtkCellGrid-improvements.md:30
msgid ""
"The accompanying `vtkDGSummaryInformationResponder` provides the responder "
"implementation for discontinuous Galerkin ( DG) cell types."
msgstr ""
